            "value" : "Cartouche rewrites the code of your own game on this iPhone with nxnative’s rewriter, as your Mac does when it builds the game’s IPA, then compares each file with the one your Mac wrote. It also measures the time and the memory this takes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
